00:11:01,935 --> 00:11:07,935
The Thin Red Line is a drama, history, war film directed by Terrence Malick.

3
00:16:32,903 --> 00:16:38,903
The story of a group of men, an Army Rifle company called C-for-Charlie, who change, suffer, and ultimately
make essential discoveries about themselves during the fierce World War II battle of Guadalcanal.

4
00:22:03,870 --> 00:22:09,870
It follows their journey, from the surprise of an unopposed landing, through the bloody and
exhausting battles that follow, to the ultimate departure of those who survived.

5
